// IntroString :
"P3600326791" "I pulled in some favors, and we're givin' ya another go. I think I got the hang of 'ow this portal thingy works, right, and it's time to test it out for real, with those coordinates you got from the Nemesis Army. 'Course, that means the Nemesis Army's probably gonna be there, to, but there's too much at stake. So we need someone who's been out there before, who can 'andle it. An' that's you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Are ya in?</A> <br>It'll be rough. Ya might want ta bring some friends."
// AcceptString :
"P660997683" "Explore some alternate dimensions."
// SendOffString :
"P4083525367" "I'm really glad ta be workin' with ya again. Alright, the first one up should be a lot of fun. We've got some strange readings from a nearby alternate world. Accordin' to tha Nemesis Army, it's in danger of fallin ta tha devourin' Earth, and the 'eroes are tryin' ta 'elp stop that from 'appenin'. We want ya ta catch one of tha 'ero commanders and find out just 'ow much is goin' on. <br>Tha commander's one a' their Ballista fellas. They're tough, real power 'ouses. Ya might want ta bring some more people."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3508579257" "Catch Longbow Commander"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2300611611" "We want ya ta catch one of tha 'ero commanders and find out just 'ow much is goin' on. <br>Tha commander's one a' their Ballista fellas. They're tough, real power 'ouses. Ya might want ta bring some more people."

