// ModelDisplayName :
"P536912896" "Nemesis Army Papers"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1489531462" "You begin searching through the files"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2370887218" "You finished searching through the files"
// InteractActionString :
"P1469950025" "Searching..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2833546095" "You found something disturbing in the files."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2076507413" "You got the Intel you were looking for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2364068771" "This can't be true. No, this has got to be impossible. I mean, 'ow could it be true? 'Ow could you be a Nemesis robot? <br><br>Now, I know what it looks like: The schematics of you, the report a' your capture, even tha telemetry. But it just can't be. I know ya. I've worked with ya. An' I know ya ain't some Nemesis machine. <br>Right? <br><br>Right?"
// RandomFameString :
"P1148061505" "I heard the Nemesis Army has backed off {VillainName}. I wonder why?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1154967705" ""I know what all tha' evidence says, {VillainName}, but I know it can't be right. Ya can't be some kinda Nemesis replicant. So, I been studyin'. I've 'eard about 'ow Nemesis likes ta mess with people's 'eads, an' I think that's whot this is. Now, I cross-checked tha 'capture report' ya found with tha deployment orders ya got before, an' 'ere's whot I found: One of tha men the report said was commandin' one a' tha teams that was supposed ta 'ave captured ya is out on 'is own explorin' a dead world. 'Is name's Captain Rick Deckard, an if ya <A HREF={ACCEPT}>catch 'im, and he can tell ya what's really goin' on.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P852033242" "Catch Captain Deckard and get the truth from him."
// SendOffString :
"P1767575884" "This time, tha Nemesis Army ain't likely ta welcome ya. Tha good news is, all ya got ta do is find Captain Deckard and get tha info ya need from him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1472632431" "Catch Captain Deckard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4257027424" "This abandoned world is cold and lifeless. It's a wonder even the Nemesis Army bothered exploring it."

