"P280020113" "You forced Captain Deckard to talk, but he said nothing that would assure you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2503082358" "You got Deckard, but you only found more questions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P753709477" "I know this looks worse an' worse, but ya can't give up. Ya gotta find out tha truth. I'll 'elp ya as far as I can."
// RandomFameString :
"P3810455249" "I've heard a rumor about {VillainName} and the Nemesis Army, but it's just too incredible to be true."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2139617775" ""The Nemesis Army claims that you're just a copy. They say that they 'ave tha real you, an' are keeping that original alive. I don't believe it, not a word. But there's others who might. An' some of 'em might start ta wonder soon. So ya gotta do this. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Ya gotta find out whot tha Nemesis Army is really up ta. Marco gave up the coordinates easy. Now comes tha 'ard part. Ya gotta go, an' I can't 'elp ya but ta get ya there.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3280772313" "Find the Truth"
// SendOffString :
"P3577416667" "The truth is goin' ta be in there somewhere. I've helped ya as much as I can, but ya gotta find it on your own, now. When it's all done, talk ta me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1265827144" "The truth is in here somewhere. You just have to find it, no matter what."

