// Dialog :
"P1923372130" "I'm livid! I'm not just gonna blow me stack, I'm gonna lose it completely! They 'ad me there an' replaced me with one a them machines! Well, tha thing ran! Right through tha portal. Probably 'ad its pick-up spot all ready set in it's tiny robotic mind. An' it's 'ad plenty a' time to learn everythin'! We gotta stop it before they can get it back! <br><br>Oh, and don't get me started on 'ow nobody knew tha difference!"

