// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3758861267" "I figured out where that robot imposter a' me went. It's back on that one abandoned world where ya caught Marko. <A HREF-{ACCEPT}>Ya gotta stop it before they can pick it up, or else it'll spill everythin' it learned.</A> All about Arachnos, an all about you, too, so don't think ya don't have a stake in this."
// AcceptString :
"P3421041670" "Destroy the Nemesis Army duplicate of Grant Naylor."
// SendOffString :
"P1801316285" "Destroy that duplicate, an' make sure ya get whatever team's around it too. Can't take any chances."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3233007108" "Destroy Fake Naylor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1207325220" "According to Naylor, his double fled back to this ruined world. Funny. It's going to be wreckage soon, too."

