// Dialog :
"P3172231217" "That wraps up that. Nemesis ain't like ta try that again, but it was a close thing. <br><br>An' worst of all, Arachnos ain't even gonna pay me back tha money a' mine that machine spent. I never 'ave any luck."
// RandomFameString :
"P1365739567" "I heard something terrifying: Nemesis has these robots that look like people! Is nowhere safe from the Prussian Prince of Automatons?"

